  "// 빌드 있는 길\nnpm create vue@latest     # create-vue · Vite · TS/Router/Pinia/Vitest 선택\nnpm run dev / npm run build  → ./dist\n\n// 빌드 없는 길 셋\n<script src=\"https://unpkg.com/vue@3/dist/vue.global.js\"></script>            // 전역 Vue — Vue.createApp(…)\n<script type=\"module\">import { createApp } from 'https://unpkg.com/vue@3/dist/vue.esm-browser.js'</script>\n<script type=\"importmap\">{ \"imports\": { \"vue\": \"https://unpkg.com/vue@3/dist/vue.esm-browser.js\" } }</script>   // import … from 'vue'\n\n// 공통 제약: SFC 불가 · 개발 빌드 (운영은 .prod.js) · file:// 불가 (npx serve)": "<span>// 빌드 있는 길</span><br><span>npm create vue@latest     # create-vue · Vite · TS/Router/Pinia/Vitest 선택</span><br><span>npm run dev / npm run build  → ./dist</span><br><span></span><br><span>// 빌드 없는 길 셋</span><br><span>&#x3C;script src=\"https://unpkg.com/vue@3/dist/vue.global.js\">&#x3C;/script>            // 전역 Vue — Vue.createApp(…)</span><br><span>&#x3C;script type=\"module\">import { createApp } from 'https://unpkg.com/vue@3/dist/vue.esm-browser.js'&#x3C;/script></span><br><span>&#x3C;script type=\"importmap\">{ \"imports\": { \"vue\": \"https://unpkg.com/vue@3/dist/vue.esm-browser.js\" } }&#x3C;/script>   // import … from 'vue'</span><br><span></span><br><span>// 공통 제약: SFC 불가 · 개발 빌드 (운영은 .prod.js) · file:// 불가 (npx serve)</span>",
